msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a "
"gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Näpunäide: ava Glimpse kohe žestiga.\n"
"\n"
"Määra üks: Seaded → Puudutused ja žestid → Žestihaldur → vali žest → Lugeja "
"→ 'Ava Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(Seda näpunäidet näidatakse ainult üks kord.)"

